    "paragraphs": [
      "I have a bike. It is red. Is it big? No, it is small. Is it old? No, it is new. It is very good!",
      "I have a bag. It is brown. It is on my bike. Is it a big bag? Yes, it is. My shoes are black. Are they new? No, they are old.",
      "I have a baseball cap. It is blue. Is it small? No, it is big. It is a good cap. I like my things. I like my red bike. Do you like it?"
    ],
